id: rail_util_built_in_phys
label: RAIL Utility, Built-in PHYs Across HFXO Frequencies (RAIL 2.x)
description: >
  Utility to include built-in (Standards based) PHYs to work with different HFXO
  frequencies. On EFR32XG24 and EFR32XG26 parts, 38.4 MHz, 39 MHz, and 40 Mhz
  HFXO support is provided by this component.
package: rail_library
category: Platform|Radio|RAIL 2.x
quality: deprecated
metadata:
  sbom:
    id: rail_util_built_in_phys
    name: RAIL Utility, Built-in PHYs Across HFXO Frequencies (RAIL 2.x)
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: rail2_util_built_in_phys
requires:
- name: sl_rail_util_built_in_phys
root_path: rail_library
